{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ba5c0ebd-bb52-59c1-b4c7-8496a6b0bd74", "source_ordinal": 2518, "reading_ordinal": 1535, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "nice guy", "published_at": "2022-11-19T18:04:53+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/409246699/answer/2765683082"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫善战？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不用防守，因为即使是偷袭，也没有谁有任何不切实际的指望。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不用进攻，因为想要的利益对方会自觉送上，以免敬酒不吃吃罚酒。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "攻无不克，所以不战而胜。", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "打都没得打，自然也就没有赫赫之功了。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这具体来讲，大概就是你敲敲门，酋长出来问你“大清早的谁特么乱敲”。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你说“打扰了，我给你表演个小魔术吧”，然后你一拍巴掌——", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "门口的火山就变没了。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "酋长说哟呵这魔术很精彩啊，朋友你吃了吗，我们家刚摊的煎饼果子又脆又香，还有一瓶八二年的拉菲明天就过期，你正好帮我喝掉。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "什么战？什么功？", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "Just a friendly guy with an irresistible nice personality.", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 301}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0237"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么理解“ 善战者无赫赫之功 ”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“nice guy”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫善战？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫善战？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "92be5828-3c0b-5970-9db9-e80783884362", "source_ordinal": 2517, "reading_ordinal": 1536, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "爱与崇拜", "published_at": "2022-11-19T22:13:27+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/444941235/answer/2765965916"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "爱你的人总会记着你有没有钱花啊，天气降温了你会不会傻到不穿毛衣啦，你是不是又瞎减肥不吃饭啦。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "爱你的人你眼里，你就是个长期高位截瘫的傻憨憨。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "虽然你手搏狮虎、断石分金，但你永远“过于善良”、“过于老实”，而且“过于任性”。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "再说，明枪易躲，暗箭难防。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所以爱你的人一天到晚在给你打钱，问你要不要给你腌点新泡菜，要不要帮你给人打个招呼。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "崇拜你的人呢？", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你这么牛的人，怎么可能不知道天冷了要加衣？穿得少一定有你的深意。你没吃一定是你要减肥，不可能是你忘了吃。你怎么可能缺钱？怎么可能不知道要注意这个、要做那个？", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "单单只是崇拜的人，很自然的就有完美的正当理由不做任何帮助。", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "爱充满“宁滥勿缺，唯恐不及”的行动，它要学的是积极寻找不滥不缺的恰当尺度。而且它要学会这个尺度的可能性是一直存在的。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "崇拜则不断天然的有不必作为的理由，而且一开始就很自然的没打算有什么改变。一旦实际产生了需要作为的理由，它就可以借着“原来你这么弱，是我看错了你/被你欺骗”的理由跑路。", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "简单来说，爱总有行动和谦卑，而崇拜则两者皆无。", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 454}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0237"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：崇拜和爱的区别是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“爱与崇拜”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“爱你的人总会记着你有没有钱花啊，天气降温了你会不会傻到不穿毛衣啦，你是不是又瞎减肥不吃饭啦。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "爱你的人总会记着你有没有钱花啊，天气降温了你会不会傻到不穿毛衣啦，你是不是又瞎减肥不吃饭啦。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "78aaaaae-b222-56cb-a439-c2a62c613e1d", "source_ordinal": 2516, "reading_ordinal": 1537, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "犬夜叉", "published_at": "2022-11-19T22:59:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/455156955/answer/2766020639"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "文科、理科只是通向“文理双全”的不同的中间站。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "到最后都需要“既精通历史和社会、又善于计算、设计和实现，而且善于表达”。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "先学理的自然要补文，先学文的自然要补理。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这只是一个“先戴左手套还是先戴右手套”的问题。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 105}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“我只戴了一只手套，好冷，我该怎么办？”", "char_start": 106, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "当然是戴上另一只手套啊，不然呢？", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "文科生、理科生，只不过是两种不同的半妖——大家都是犬夜叉，一个先修尾巴，一个先修耳朵而已。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "继续修炼，成人才算。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 200}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0237"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：政史地文科生能干什么? 中国文科生过量，那文科生应该怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“犬夜叉”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“文科、理科只是通向“文理双全”的不同的中间站。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "文科、理科只是通向“文理双全”的不同的中间站。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9c06dc01-31b5-5e34-a3bc-8783d86bdda9", "source_ordinal": 2515, "reading_ordinal": 1538, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "骗局", "published_at": "2022-11-22T10:08:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/284150670/answer/2769177291"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫骗局？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你满怀美好的期望，结果落实下来不如你的预期，而且你认为错不在你，就叫骗局，是这样吗？", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "所以只要世界上存在足够多的同样“期望很高、失望很大、错不在我”的过来人，就可以证明“xx是骗局”，是吗？", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "那何止管培生是骗局。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 113}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "父母也是骗局，教育也是骗局、专业也是骗局、朋友也是骗局、恋爱也是骗局、婚姻也是骗局、职场也是骗局、生育也是骗局、医院也是骗局、养老也是骗局。", "char_start": 114, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这里面哪一样缺“期望很高，失望很大”的“过来人”？", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要多少，有多少，数量论亿、论十亿、论百亿好吗？", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "然后你怎样？遁入空门么？", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 247}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "那不好意思，根据同一论证逻辑，宗教也是骗局啊。", "char_start": 248, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "按这个论证逻辑，只有一样东西不是骗局，那就是zs。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这是真的不会有过来人在网上告诉你“zs没你想象的那么美好”了。因为至少到目前为止死人还没法上网。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一点不客气，这就是世间千万件事中唯一一件不会有过来人向你哭诉骗局的事。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "于是无意识的过来人们组成了一条逻辑传送带，注定要将咬死这种骗局论证法的人送到这个逻辑法场。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "只要你不想死，你必须抛弃这个论证法。你不抛弃这个论证法，你每分每秒都在逼近这个逻辑终局。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "只要你还在遵循这个方法论证骗局，那么“管培生是不是骗局”根本不是你最该关心的问题。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你还没觉得人生的一切都是骗局，仅仅是大脑运转频率太低的结果。大脑一旦发育起来，“聪明”起来，一天时间你就可以飞到那个逻辑坟场。", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 579}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "牛头马面站门口给你发广告——环境优雅，童叟无欺，直接入住，包都不拎。", "char_start": 580, "char_end": 614}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "大粗黑体印中央——", "char_start": 615, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "heading", "index": 19, "text": "“创世以来零差评”。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你要进去么？", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这样进去了你觉得是世界的责任，还是你自己的责任？", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这其实是蠢死的。", "char_start": 668, "char_end": 676}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "记住了——", "char_start": 678, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "heading", "index": 24, "text": "让你失望，也让很多别的人失望，并不是判定为骗局的充分条件。", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 713}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这一点要拿凿子来用大铁锤刻在脑门上，否则你这辈子不会好过。", "char_start": 714, "char_end": 743}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "真正的问题根本不是骗局，而是你有没有不失望的能力。", "char_start": 744, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "什么叫不失望的能力？", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 781}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "不失望建立在对期待的有效管理之上。", "char_start": 782, "char_end": 799}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "期待是一条见谁咬谁的疯狗。", "char_start": 800, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "对待自己的期待，要像遛狗一定要牵绳一样，没拴好干脆不要出门。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 844}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这是个基本公德问题。", "char_start": 845, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "那么什么叫期待管理？", "char_start": 856, "char_end": 866}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "有一条总的原则——你要期待什么，一定要能找到能上法庭打赢官司的依据。", "char_start": 867, "char_end": 901}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "法庭有两个。", "char_start": 902, "char_end": 908}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "一个是人类的法庭，这个法庭看合同正文，看法律。", "char_start": 909, "char_end": 932}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "所以你必须把语文和法律学好一点，裁判文书网多看看。千万人跟你说什么什么“天经地义”都是鬼扯，你最好分清楚这些人跟法官的区别。", "char_start": 933, "char_end": 995}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "坦率讲，虽然契约是跟你签的，但对方实质上是对法庭负责，而非对你负责——客观上ta只需要保证法庭不追究，不需要保证你满意。", "char_start": 996, "char_end": 1056}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "而法庭的标准离小孩子们想象的标准相差之远，不可以道里计。", "char_start": 1057, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "另一个法庭就是客观世界。", "char_start": 1087, "char_end": 1099}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你期待一个人饿了会想吃饭，ta要是令你失望，用不着你去哪里去告ta，ta的胃自然会教育ta。", "char_start": 1100, "char_end": 1146}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "与其说那是你的期待，不如说是客观世界世界对人的期待。ta不敢令世界失望，自然不会令你失望。", "char_start": 1147, "char_end": 1192}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "如果ta令你失这种望，立刻就有一大堆自然规律即刻开始收紧绞索，用不着你敲锣打鼓到处召唤别人替你出头。", "char_start": 1193, "char_end": 1243}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "世界上没有人能硬得过自然规律，也没有人能在令你失了这种望之后逃脱惩罚。", "char_start": 1244, "char_end": 1279}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "当你的期待与世界的期待重合，欺骗这个罪名对你就是多余的工具。", "char_start": 1280, "char_end": 1310}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "世界的期待，一旦落空，自然规律负责惩戒，成本为零。", "char_start": 1312, "char_end": 1337}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "法律的期待，一旦落空，你要交一笔手续费，其他成本由全体社会成员补贴。", "char_start": 1338, "char_end": 1372}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "在这两条线之上还能不能有期待？", "char_start": 1373, "char_end": 1388}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "能，但要自费。", "char_start": 1389, "char_end": 1396}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "达到了，你自费奖励。", "char_start": 1397, "char_end": 1407}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "没达到，你自费惩罚。", "char_start": 1408, "char_end": 1418}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "绝大多数哭诉“骗局”的人，本质上只是对人有这种需要自费的期待，却妄想由对方——或者不论什么别的人都行——来替ta承担成本。", "char_start": 1420, "char_end": 1481}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "ta们一般都认为“付出期待”本身就已经算是下了大血本了。", "char_start": 1482, "char_end": 1510}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "世界上哪来这么便宜的事？", "char_start": 1511, "char_end": 1523}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 57, "heading": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0237"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：管培生是不是骗局？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053"], "summary": "围绕“骗局”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫骗局？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫骗局？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0abed7ff-a5ce-58fe-929f-20ef0fa26e70", "source_ordinal": 2514, "reading_ordinal": 1539, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "羊了个羊", "published_at": "2022-11-22T23:32:14+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/568157415/answer/2770337012"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "显而易见的，疫情对快递、物流、电商行业虽然会带来一段明显的冲击，但长期看是一个重大的行业利好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人们会比疫情前更严重的依赖快递物流和电商购物。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而京东作为电商巨头还尤其以自己的快递体系为核心优势。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是一个新的跑马圈地的时代，技能、经验、心态成熟的基层快递员就是这战役最关键的战略资源。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "谁稳住自己的快递员团队，谁就在这个新行情里占有优势——或者至少不居于下风。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这一点撑不住，可能变成对手的盘中餐。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不知道你们注意到没有——对面的阿里悄无声息的把“菜鸟”体系进一步的整合成了丹鸟快递。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这可不是“四通一达一起在菜鸟app上接单”的概念了，而是以“落地配”为主营业务，以盒马、天猫、农村淘宝等“近卫业务”为需求支撑的新对手。", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "说白了，就是直接对准京东来的。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "【聚焦】换帅更名后丹鸟获阿里融资，同城物流阿里如何落子？\n丹鸟改名菜鸟：一字之差能否一雪前耻_艾瑞专栏_艾瑞网", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "京东的这个动作其实已经是被动应战了。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "至于说什么“拿出一百亿”“管理层减薪”云云，其实多半是说说而已。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "一旦各路人马整合完成，没有加入任何山头的小快递就只能接接同城闪送、省内急送、城乡快运之类的短距单了。一旦跨省、跨地区的全国性快递只剩那么两三个玩家，就会出现不约而同的提价行为。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 524}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "一个包裹加一块、外加有力的快递为自家的销售助力引流，一手从利润里拿、一手靠漂亮的报表到资本市场里拿，这一百亿都轻松填平。", "char_start": 525, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "到时候高管们“薪酬”减下去了，但绩效和期权、股权涨上去了，搞不好年底一算拿得还更多了。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "记住一条——", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 636}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "企业做任何支出，最后都不是老板买单，而是客户买单。", "char_start": 637, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "heading", "index": 18, "text": "是你们在买单。", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 670}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你们其实更应该夸夸自己。", "char_start": 671, "char_end": 683}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18, "heading": 1}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 329, "sample": "【聚焦】换帅更名后丹鸟获阿里融资，同城物流阿里如何落子？\n丹鸟改名菜鸟：一字之差能否一雪前耻_艾瑞专栏_艾瑞网"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0237"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待刘强东发京东全员信，提出副总监级别以上降薪 10％-20％ ，以提高基层员工福利待遇等?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“羊了个羊”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“显而易见的，疫情对快递、物流、电商行业虽然会带来一段明显的冲击，但长期看是一个重大的行业利好。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "显而易见的，疫情对快递、物流、电商行业虽然会带来一段明显的冲击，但长期看是一个重大的行业利好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3b85813f-ec88-5770-9f17-eb60f1701990", "source_ordinal": 2513, "reading_ordinal": 1540, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "拿你一双方便筷", "published_at": "2022-11-24T02:31:23+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/19813165/answer/2771979126"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "第一个问题是——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "问问题是不是一种理所当然的权利？", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "对应的，回答问题是不是一种理所当然的义务？", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "很多小朋友并没有仔细思考过这个问题，只是延续着自己幼年在学校的习惯，张口就问；被别人问了，也往往努力回答。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但这其实是一个误会。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个问答机制其实只是专门存在于教育者与受教育者之间的契约关系，并不是理所当然的默认存在于所有人之间的。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 164}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所有人之间，默认是没有应答义务的。", "char_start": 165, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "换言之，凡是问人，就要准备报答。因为回答你的人客观上并不是不需要补偿，而是在进行一种信用借贷。", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "别人未现场取偿而付出的回答你问题的努力，实际上是一种无抵押贷款。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "无抵押贷款，都很自然是额度极其有限、还期极其紧迫的。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "为什么要说这个？", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为人慢慢习得“不想问问题”的习性，几乎总是因为意识不到这个规则的存在，漫不经心借了、赖了大量的无抵押贷款，从而被其他人施以报复的结果。", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "因为这种无抵押贷款的限额，小到只够对方说完第一段回答而已。而这贷款的还期，也短到你的第一次回应为止。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你的第一句回应——无论答案本身是否令你满意——就需要向对方支付点什么，已经该让对方感觉到至少回本了。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "否则，从下一秒开始，你已经成了失信借贷人，甚至一个骗贷者。", "char_start": 472, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这之后的对话，都是发生在出现了呆坏账的银行和失信人、骗贷者之间。", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "可想而知，每一次的体验都会极差。", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 551}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "对方自己即使没有明确的、自觉的认知，也会不知不觉的从“亏了钱的放贷方”的立场出发继续下面的互动。", "char_start": 552, "char_end": 600}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你要是早上去早餐店不要钱拿方便筷，隔三差五就去拿，拿上足够多次，你都可能被人砍死。", "char_start": 602, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而一双方便筷才一两分钱，人家回答你的问题随口花个十分钟，就是……懒得算，但是绝对远超这一两分钱。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 692}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为ta亲身花了时间，那每秒钟都是命。", "char_start": 693, "char_end": 712}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你横行乡里二十多年，每隔三五天就挑一家摊子，见面就是一把筷子给人顺走。", "char_start": 713, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "顺走你还没自己用，而是一转身就给人扔门口了。", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 771}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "何止扔门口，还经常嫌一把筷子解决不了你的问题，还骂骂咧咧。", "char_start": 772, "char_end": 801}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你说你，至今四肢健全，是不是该感激乡亲们刀下留人？", "char_start": 802, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "说句直白的，以这个常识的普遍匮乏程度，我国的人口可以达到14亿，纯属是先贤教化有方、人民本性善良的结果。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 880}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "可想而知，摊主们是没什么好脸的。", "char_start": 881, "char_end": 897}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "次次去都没好脸色，而自己又不清楚为什么，还觉得自己完全无辜，可不就觉得“问问题就是自轻自贱，被人糟蹋”么？", "char_start": 898, "char_end": 951}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "人家方便筷都被你祸害了，生意都没法做，你还觉得自己受了人的委屈，发狠“再也不要去你家拿免费筷子了”。", "char_start": 952, "char_end": 1002}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "要学习“自己解决问题”。", "char_start": 1003, "char_end": 1015}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你也不必受气了，人家也止损了，这其实不是一件双赢的好事么？", "char_start": 1016, "char_end": 1045}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "很多人都想问“如何正确的问问题”。", "char_start": 1047, "char_end": 1064}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "其实正确的问问题就一个门槛，既不是“先做研究”，也不是“精准措辞”。", "char_start": 1065, "char_end": 1099}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "而是——", "char_start": 1100, "char_end": 1104}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "heading", "index": 35, "text": "有问必谢，凡答必酬。", "char_start": 1105, "char_end": 1115}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "为什么说这是唯一的门槛？", "char_start": 1117, "char_end": 1129}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "因为只要树立了“必酬”的意识，", "char_start": 1130, "char_end": 1145}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你自然会去先做研究的——否则你自己都会痛惜这份血汗钱打了水漂。", "char_start": 1146, "char_end": 1177}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你自然会再三琢磨表达准确——否则一样血汗钱打水漂。", "char_start": 1178, "char_end": 1203}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你也自然会慎重选择有用的、答案能值回本钱的问题，避免那些问来无用、徒耗资金的无聊问题。", "char_start": 1204, "char_end": 1247}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "你也会更在意问题的实际质量，容不得糊涂含混、蒙混过关。久而久之，你也会知道什么问题该问谁。", "char_start": 1248, "char_end": 1293}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "你也自然会记得“及时还贷”——谢字不离口。", "char_start": 1294, "char_end": 1315}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "及时还贷是会降低贷款利率、提高借贷额度、延长宽限期限的——那就是真金白银的赚钱。", "char_start": 1316, "char_end": 1356}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "你拿到这些付出了真金白银的答案后，也自然珍惜，要投入生产实践、产生效益。", "char_start": 1357, "char_end": 1393}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "久而久之，自然会形成正循环。", "char_start": 1394, "char_end": 1408}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "你会发现，这其实是人类最好做的生意，最有效的利益来源。", "char_start": 1409, "char_end": 1436}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "开始赚钱了，自然就没有什么“不想问人”了。", "char_start": 1437, "char_end": 1458}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "因为你难道不喜欢赚钱？", "char_start": 1459, "char_end": 1470}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "看到没有，那就什么都好起来了。", "char_start": 1472, "char_end": 1487}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "就这一个要害，你做到即可。", "char_start": 1489, "char_end": 1502}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 55, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0237"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何克服不喜欢问问题的心态，如何学会善于问问题？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050"], "summary": "围绕“拿你一双方便筷”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“第一个问题是——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "第一个问题是——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "38755633-d5ea-52ad-a014-47251464712e", "source_ordinal": 2512, "reading_ordinal": 1541, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "去势", "published_at": "2022-11-26T11:31:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/568533689/answer/2775377528"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你要比较好的把握一件事情，有一个思维方式要改变。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "就是一句说烂了的话——“动态的看待问题”。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "很多人觉得这句话的意思是“经常改变判断和立场”的美化说法，然后就当耳边风了，这是一个巨大的失误。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "什么叫动态的看待问题？", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "比方说有一个小球滚下斜坡。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "动态的看待问题，就是从“小球开始滚”一直看到根据已知条件能预测到的极限，其结论是“小球每一个时间点的每一个状态”。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "相对的，什么叫“静态的看待问题”？", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "就是“看到小球此刻的状态”，其结论就是“小球此刻的状态”。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "对于后者，因为下一时刻小球就不在原位了，意味着自己的预期已经要随之改变了，于是总是要惊恐的探讨“xx因素会对局势产生什么影响”。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "ta的意思是，有什么因素会影响下一时刻小球的位置。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但是对前者，在一开始形成结论的时候，其结论就不是“此刻的位置”，而是“从此一稳态至下一稳态的全部过程”，能被视为“改变局势的影响”就不是指“小球此刻撞到的凹坑”这样的东西。", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为对动态观察者而言，这个凹坑一开始就看到了，已经是之前结论的一部分了。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "只有突然在公式中出现了原来公式里没有纳入计算的要素——比如斜坡突然断了，或者天上伸出一只手指来挡在小球前面，会影响到对“小球的下一个稳态及其逼近该稳态的路径”的总体判断——才能被视为“对局势发生了影响”。", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 545}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "后者的“局势”，指的是现在这一刻的历史横断面。", "char_start": 546, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "前者的“局势”，本质上指的是从此刻直到一段历史的下一节点的整个段落。", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 604}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "后者认为只要改变现状，就算局势发生了改变，其实是把“局势”这个词“去势”了。", "char_start": 605, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "当ta们谈论“局势”时，ta们在谈论的其实是“局面”。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "局面没你想的那么重要，甚至根本无关紧要。", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 692}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "现在回头来看现在这个问题，你就会发现，我对这个问题的回答是——", "char_start": 694, "char_end": 725}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这种轰炸对（我所判定的）局势没有影响，因为它从一开始就是“局势”中“势”的组成部分之一。", "char_start": 726, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "从一开始我就判断过到这个阶段会出现这一幕，本来就是计划中的事。", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 802}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这件事很自然的从开始就会这么演变。", "char_start": 803, "char_end": 820}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这是整个动力学所自然要催生出来的现象，就像卵要变成蝌蚪，蝌蚪要长出手脚，然后会变青蛙。", "char_start": 821, "char_end": 864}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这个问题等效于——“蝌蚪长出了脚对它变成青蛙有啥影响”。", "char_start": 865, "char_end": 893}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这还真不好回答。", "char_start": 894, "char_end": 902}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0237"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：乌克兰全境进入停电状态，首都基辅暂停供水，目前情况如何？会对俄乌局势产生哪些影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“去势”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你要比较好的把握一件事情，有一个思维方式要改变。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你要比较好的把握一件事情，有一个思维方式要改变。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b96ba498-99bc-598f-bddb-ac696e80d523", "source_ordinal": 2511, "reading_ordinal": 1542, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "谣止于勤", "published_at": "2022-11-26T13:08:31+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/568741475/answer/2775502547"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "先看点基本资料。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "消防车上常规的备有电锯、消防斧、液压剪以及各种奇奇怪怪的破拆设备。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "就是消防车自身，能拉这么多人、这么多水、这么多装备，整备全重至少15-30吨。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是轻型消防车：", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这是重型消防车：", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这是消防队手里的家伙：", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这是防疫围挡：", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 123}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你觉得它能对消防队造成作业困难么？", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "别说铁丝固定的简易铁皮门。就是整框固定的防盗门在消防员面前也是常规破拆项目——防盗门都拆不开还救啥火？", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 194}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以哪来什么“防疫物理阻隔导致消防队进不去”的可能性？", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那么就是在主张非物理因素了？", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "那么这是在主张地方主管部门会下令“疫区禁止消防救火”？", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "还是觉得社区人员会傻到“纯凭自己主观判断，不准消防车进入”？", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "还是觉得消防队会软弱到“社区工作人员不让进就算了”？", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "搞清楚，消防局以前是隶属武警部队的，现在也是独立部门。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "发生严重事故更大的可能是“起火的这家有某种易燃的因素”、“楼梯设计缺少逃生通道”、“失火位置太高”、“消防通道堆杂物”、“小区车辆堵塞消防通道”、“民众缺少防火演练”、“消防失职反应迟钝”、“调度失职反应迟钝”这类常规性的因素。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 469}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "跟疫情的关系基本为零。", "char_start": 470, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不要跟着起哄。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 489}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "有人敢这样暗示，也有人真的表演“确信”，你就真的跟着“痛心”了。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你觉得要不要反省一下？", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "heading", "index": 21, "text": "客观事实说明，操纵你的门槛非常的低，甚至不需要量身定制。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "为了煽动没法查资料的人而设计的量产的骗局，顺手就把你这个能查资料的捎走了。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 602}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "谣言并不止于智者。", "char_start": 603, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "查到上面这些资料的智，你没有吗？", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "那么你为什么还是跟着跑了？", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "heading", "index": 26, "text": "谣止于勤。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 649}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-11/26/c57023ce5cc9e904076b1604be411b91.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-11/26/47a248a3a4ec3a1ee87bb8b086993fed.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG003", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-11/26/d9634e522d520a8df766f7b37d896ce6.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG004", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-11/26/443f507066c332461313448eb70d8c22.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG005", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-11/26/d37b167cf99157bc675be225b360b821.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG006", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-11/26/7f272e057284bf2acd3f45e71fcb92b2.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 41, "image": 6, "heading": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0237"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：新疆乌鲁木齐一高层住宅楼发生火灾，已造成 10 人死亡，事故原因可能是什么？高层发生火灾如何自救？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“谣止于勤”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“先看点基本资料。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "先看点基本资料。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
